---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Downloads｜J 的世界 Research">
  <main class="downloads-page">
    <section class="downloads-hero">
      <div class="downloads-hero-inner">
        <div class="kicker">DOWNLOADS · RESEARCH LIBRARY · V1.1-10-D</div>
        <h1>研究資料庫</h1>
        <p>從 Research、Industry Maps、Posters 到 First Printing，將《J 的世界 Research》的研究內容集中保存，建立可以閱讀、下載與持續追蹤的研究資料庫。</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="downloads-section featured">
      <div class="downloads-section-inner">
        <div class="kicker">FEATURED EDITION</div>
        <h2>Research Vol.01</h2>
        <p class="edition-title">AI Platform Evolution · P1–P8</p>
        <article class="download-feature-card">
          <div class="kicker">VOL.01 · FIRST PRINTING</div>
          <h3>AI Platform Evolution</h3>
          <p>從台積電 2026 China Technology Symposium 出發，拆解 AI Platform 從先進製程、先進封裝、光互連、Glass Core、材料設備，一路延伸至 AI Infrastructure 的完整技術路徑。</p>
          <div class="download-tags"><span>P1–P8</span><span>Facts First</span><span>Evidence-Based Research</span><span>First Printing</span></div>
          <div class="download-actions">
            <a class="download-button" href="/research/">閱讀 Research →</a>
            <a class="download-button secondary" href="/maps/">Industry Maps</a>
            <a class="download-button secondary" href="/posters/">Posters Gallery</a>
            <a class="download-button secondary" href="/downloads/J的世界_Research_Vol01_First_Printing.pdf">開啟 First Printing PDF ↗</a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="downloads-section">
      <div class="downloads-section-inner">
        <div class="kicker">FIRST PRINTING</div>
        <h2>Research Vol.01 · 印刷級版本</h2>
        <article class="printing-card">
          <div class="printing-cover">
            <span>Digital Archive</span>
            <strong>J 的世界 Research</strong>
            <b>VOL.01</b>
            <em>AI Platform<br />Evolution</em>
            <small>Facts First · Evidence-Based Research</small>
            <small>2026</small>
            <span>FIRST PRINTING · PDF</span>
          </div>
          <div class="printing-copy">
            <h3>《J 的世界 Research Vol.01》</h3>
            <p>第一版完整研究出版品。收錄 P1–P8 研究架構，從事件、Evidence、Technology，到 Glass Core、Investment Matrix 與 Future Watch。</p>
            <div class="printing-index">
              <span>P1–P2<br /><b>Story · Evidence</b></span>
              <span>P3–P5<br /><b>AI Platform · Technology</b></span>
              <span>P6–P8<br /><b>Investment Matrix · Methodology</b></span>
            </div>
            <a class="download-button" href="/downloads/J的世界_Research_Vol01_First_Printing.pdf">開啟 First Printing →</a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="downloads-section navigation-section">
      <div class="downloads-section-inner">
        <div class="kicker">RESEARCH NAVIGATION</div>
        <h2>從 PDF 回到研究</h2>
        <p>Research → Maps → Posters</p>
        <div class="download-grid three">
          <article class="download-card"><span>01 · RESEARCH</span><h3>完整研究文章</h3><p>閱讀 Research Vol.01 完整內容，了解 AI Platform Evolution 的研究邏輯與技術路徑。</p><a href="/research/">Open Research →</a></article>
          <article class="download-card"><span>02 · INDUSTRY MAPS</span><h3>產業地圖</h3><p>將研究中的技術節點重新整理成 AI Ecosystem、Glass Core 與 CPO 三張核心產業地圖。</p><a href="/maps/">Open Industry Maps →</a></article>
          <article class="download-card"><span>03 · POSTERS</span><h3>研究海報</h3><p>將複雜研究濃縮成一頁式視覺內容，適合快速理解研究主題與產業關係。</p><a href="/posters/">Open Posters →</a></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="downloads-section">
      <div class="downloads-section-inner">
        <div class="kicker">EDITION STRUCTURE</div>
        <h2>Research Vol.01 的四種閱讀方式</h2>
        <div class="download-grid four">
          <article class="download-card"><span>01</span><strong>READ</strong><h3>Research</h3><p>以文章形式完整閱讀研究內容，理解事件、證據與技術推論。</p><a href="/research/">進入 Research →</a></article>
          <article class="download-card"><span>02</span><strong>MAP</strong><h3>Industry Maps</h3><p>用產業鏈視角快速理解技術節點與供應鏈位置。</p><a href="/maps/">進入 Industry Maps →</a></article>
          <article class="download-card"><span>03</span><strong>VISUAL</strong><h3>Posters</h3><p>用視覺化方式快速掌握一個研究主題的核心訊號。</p><a href="/posters/">進入 Posters →</a></article>
          <article class="download-card"><span>04</span><strong>PRINT</strong><h3>First Printing</h3><p>將完整研究保存成正式印刷級 PDF 出版版本。</p><a href="/downloads/J的世界_Research_Vol01_First_Printing.pdf">開啟 PDF →</a></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="downloads-section status-section">
      <div class="downloads-section-inner">
        <div class="kicker">RESEARCH STATUS</div>
        <h2>Evidence Framework</h2>
        <p class="facts-first">Facts First</p>
        <div class="download-grid three">
          <article class="evidence-card"><span>01</span><b>FACT</b><h3>公開資訊</h3><p>公司公告、官方技術資料、公開文件與可驗證資訊。</p></article>
          <article class="evidence-card"><span>02</span><b>EVIDENCE</b><h3>驗證與導入</h3><p>技術驗證、客戶導入、製程整合與量產進度。</p></article>
          <article class="evidence-card"><span>03</span><b>INFERENCE</b><h3>產業推論</h3><p>尚未正式公告，但值得持續追蹤的技術與供應鏈研究假設。</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="downloads-closing">
      <div class="downloads-section-inner">
        <div class="kicker">J 的世界 RESEARCH</div>
        <h2>從一份 PDF，<br />建立一套可以持續更新的研究系統。</h2>
        <p>Research 是內容，Industry Maps 是結構，Posters 是視覺，First Printing 則是完整保存。</p>
        <a class="download-button" href="/research/">回到 Research →</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <style is:global>
    .downloads-page { text-align: center; }
    .downloads-page .downloads-hero,
    .downloads-page .downloads-section,
    .downloads-page .downloads-closing { border-bottom: 1px solid #263242; }
    .downloads-page .downloads-hero-inner,
    .downloads-page .downloads-section-inner { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 70px 24px; }
    .downloads-page .downloads-hero-inner { padding-top: 82px; padding-bottom: 72px; }
    .downloads-page .kicker { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .15em; color: #8fa6bf; font-weight: 800; }
    .downloads-page h1 { margin: 12px 0 18px; font-size: clamp(46px, 7vw, 78px); line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -.05em; }
    .downloads-page h2 { margin: 10px 0 14px; font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 52px); line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -.045em; }
    .downloads-page h3 { margin: 12px 0 8px; }
    .downloads-page p { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; color: #aeb9c6; line-height: 1.85; }
    .downloads-page .edition-title { color: #8fa6bf; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .download-feature-card, .printing-card, .download-card, .evidence-card { border: 1px solid #2b394a; background: rgba(18,27,38,.82); border-radius: 18px; }
    .download-feature-card { max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 34px; }
    .download-tags, .download-actions, .printing-index { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin-top: 24px; }
    .download-tags span { border: 1px solid #354457; border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 12px; color: #8fa6bf; font-size: 11px; }
    .download-button { display: inline-block; padding: 11px 17px; border: 1px solid #53677d; border-radius: 9px; background: #e9eef4; color: #0b1017 !important; font-weight: 800; font-size: 13px; text-decoration: none; }
    .download-button.secondary { background: transparent; color: #c6d1dc !important; }
    .printing-card { max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 28px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: .8fr 1.2fr; gap: 34px; align-items: center; }
    .printing-cover { min-height: 330px; padding: 30px; border: 1px solid #354457; border-radius: 12px; background: linear-gradient(145deg,#111b26,#0b1119); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; }
    .printing-cover span, .printing-cover small { color: #7f8d9d; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .08em; }
    .printing-cover strong { font-size: 19px; }
    .printing-cover b { color: #7188a0; letter-spacing: .16em; }
    .printing-cover em { font-style: normal; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.05; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.04em; }
    .printing-copy { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
    .printing-copy p { max-width: 560px; }
    .printing-index span { min-width: 145px; padding: 12px; border-top: 1px solid #354457; color: #7188a0; font-size: 11px; }
    .printing-index b { color: #c6d1dc; }
    .download-grid { display: grid; gap: 18px; margin-top: 30px; }
    .download-grid.three { grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); }
    .download-grid.four { grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr); }
    .download-card, .evidence-card { padding: 28px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
    .download-card > span, .evidence-card > span { color: #7f9bb7; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .12em; }
    .download-card strong { margin-top: 14px; color: #8fa6bf; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .12em; }
    .download-card h3, .evidence-card h3 { font-size: 20px; }
    .download-card p, .evidence-card p { font-size: 13px; }
    .download-card a { margin-top: 20px; color: #aebdcb; font-size: 12px; text-decoration: none; }
    .facts-first { color: #8fa6bf !important; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .08em; }
    .evidence-card b { margin-top: 14px; color: #7188a0; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .1em; }
    .downloads-closing .downloads-section-inner { padding-top: 80px; padding-bottom: 90px; }
    .downloads-closing p { margin-bottom: 26px; }
    @media(max-width:900px){ .download-grid.four,.download-grid.three{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.printing-card{grid-template-columns:1fr} }
    @media(max-width:600px){ .download-grid.four,.download-grid.three{grid-template-columns:1fr}.downloads-page .downloads-hero-inner,.downloads-page .downloads-section-inner{padding-left:18px;padding-right:18px}.download-feature-card,.printing-card{padding:20px}.printing-cover{min-height:280px} }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
